<title>USA: Boston Chicken says has no Hudson beef.</title>
<headline>Boston Chicken says has no Hudson beef.</headline>
<dateline>GOLDEN, Colo. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boston Chicken Inc said Friday its Boston Market restaurants had absolutely no beef products of Hudson Foods Inc, which is recalling 1.2 milion pounds of frozen hamburger patties nationwide.</p>
<p>The company repeated it does not use frozen beef patties in any products and has thoroughly checked throughout its system for any ground beef produced at Hudson's plant.</p>
</text>
